{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object approached, scan properties, take it; or move to visible path. Else scan area for objects. Subtree for specific task. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ScanObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = SpecificTask    /> <Action ID = IsPathVisible    /> <Action ID = MoveToPath    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObjects    />  <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    />\"",
    "BT": {
